th (goals, audience, competitors, tech, taste). Attachments like pitch decks, brand guides, and references help but aren\\'t required. It auto-saves as you go.'"},{"line_number":30,"content":"  title=\"Start a Project · KR8TIV — free 30-min call or 8-min intake\""},{"line_number":31,"content":"  description=\"Start a new brand, web, motion, video or AI project with KR8TIV. Book a free no-obligation call at calendly.com/kr8tiv — or fill out the 10-section intake (auto-saves). We accept crypto and fiat.\""},{"line_number":32,"content":"  canonical=\"/start/\""},{"line_number":492,"content":"          <h3 id=\"intake-summary-title\">Intake sent.</h3>"}]},{"path":"/workspace/kio-seo-imagine/src/pages/work.astro","matches":[{"line_number":28,"content":"  title=\"Selected Work · Studio Lab · Code Vault — KR8TIV\""},{"line_number":29,"content":"  description=\"Honest portfolio. Client work, own-company products, personal R&D, and three GitHub orgs. Every piece tagged for what it actually is — no agency theatre.\""}]}]},"locations":[]}
