{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-8014962a-6fd8-49ff-80ca-5ea1a7d3a7f6-12","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"OCESS ABOUT CONTACT VOL · 08 / PRISM Our process Nine steps · Ten clients a year · One person accountable. KONTACT ● KONVERSE ● KOLLECT ● KONCEPTz ● KONVERGE ● KR8TE ● KONNECT ● KLOSING ● KARE ● DESIGN SAMURAI 侍 ● BRANDING ALCHEMY ● FOUNDER-FIRST ● NO CORPORATE CRINGE ● DIRECT-TO-FOUNDER ● FAST · HONEST · BOUTIQUE ● MEMORABLE › GENERIC ● BUILT BY A FOUNDER · FOR FOUNDERS ● $20 CARDS → $50K REBRANDS ● ACCESSIBLE ≠\n\\n=== /services/branding/ ===\ntitle: Branding & Logo Design in Edmonton | KR8TIV\ndesc: Build a clear brand with KR8TIV in Edmonton. Logo design, visual identity, brand voice, and a system for your website, signage, packaging, and print.\ncanon: https://kr8tiv.io/services/branding/\nrobots: index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1\nh1: [\"A brand with a world of its own .\"]\nwords: \u001b[33m547\u001b[39m video: \u001b[33m2\u001b[39m scripts: \u001b[33m11\u001b[39m\nflags: query \"branding\" missing from H1 | query \"edmonton\" missing from H1\nout: /, /work/, /process/, /blog/, /start/, /terms/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /services/print-signage-design/\nin: /404, /blog/blog-that-ranks-and-brings-leads/, /blog/, /blog/local-advertising-edmonton-alberta/, /blog/marketing-campaign-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/, /blog/website-that-earns-its-keep-alberta/, /, /menu-lab/, /process/, /services/print-signage-design/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /start/, /terms/, /work/\nunres: \n100: 侍 KR8TIV / · 08 HOME DOCTRINE WHY WORK PROCESS NOTES START TERMS 780-915-5471 ⌘ K Edmonton · Branding + identity A brand with a world of its own . The logo is the hello. The rest is how people remember you. KR8TIV connects the identity, the words and the places your customers meet the business—from a phone screen to the storefront. Scoped to the business · Quoted before work starts Build the right first impression → 01 · Direction Set the direction before the assets. Start with what you sell, who buys it, and why they should choose you.\n\\n=== /services/print-signage-design/ ===\ntitle: Storefront & Sign Design in Edmonton | KR8TIV\ndesc: Edmonton storefront, sign and immersive store design. Concepts from about $500 CAD; variable-rate project management across Alberta and Canada.\ncanon: https://kr8tiv.io/services/print-signage-design/\nrobots: index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1\nh1: [\"From first sketch to storefront. One clear direction.\"]\nwords: \u001b[33m763\u001b[39m video: \u001b[33m2\u001b[39m scripts: \u001b[33m12\u001b[39m\nflags: query \"sign\" missing from H1 | query \"edmonton\" missing from H1\nout: /, /work/, /process/, /blog/, /start/, /terms/, /services/branding/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/\nin: /404, /blog/blog-that-ranks-and-brings-leads/, /blog/, /blog/local-advertising-edmonton-alberta/, /blog/marketing-campaign-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/, /blog/website-that-earns-its-keep-alberta/, /, /menu-lab/, /process/, /services/branding/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /start/, /terms/, /work/\nunres: \n100: 侍 KR8TIV / · 08 HOME DOCTRINE WHY WORK PROCESS NOTES START TERMS 780-915-5471 ⌘ K Edmonton · Storefront + sign design From first sketch to storefront. One clear direction. A beautiful sign gets you noticed. A whole store world makes the visit feel right. KR8TIV connects the storefront, the space and the details—then can manage the journey that gets the idea into the real world. Sign concepts from about $500 CAD · Full project management at variable rates Tell Matt what you’re building → 01 · Who does what We design and manage. Specialists build. KR8TIV designs and manages.\n\\n=== /services/web-design-edmonton/ ===\ntitle: Web Design in Edmonton | KR8TIV\ndesc: Founder-led web design in Edmonton. Memorable websites, clear offers and search foundations for Alberta and Canadian businesses. Full websites from $1,200 CAD.\ncanon: https://kr8tiv.io/services/web-design-edmonton/\nrobots: index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1\nh1: [\"Web design in Edmonton. Built to be remembered.\"]\nwords: \u001b[33m681\u001b[39m video: \u001b[33m2\u001b[39m scripts: \u001b[33m11\u001b[39m\nflags: ok\nout: /, /work/, /process/, /blog/, /start/, /terms/, /services/branding/, /services/print-signage-design/\nin: /404, /blog/blog-that-ranks-and-brings-leads/, /blog/, /blog/local-advertising-edmonton-alberta/, /blog/marketing-campaign-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/, /blog/website-that-earns-its-keep-alberta/, /, /menu-lab/, /process/, /services/branding/, /services/print-signage-design/, /start/, /terms/, /work/\nunres: \n100: 侍 KR8TIV / · 08 HOME DOCTRINE WHY WORK PROCESS NOTES START TERMS 780-915-5471 ⌘ K Edmonton · Web design Web design in Edmonton. Built to be remembered. Your website should feel like your business on its best day—and make it obvious how to hire you. Work directly with Matt on the look, the words and the route from curious visitor to real conversation. Full websites from $1,200 CAD · Landing pages from $600 CAD · Scope agreed before the build Show Matt what needs to change → 01 · Clarity Pretty is the invitation. Clear is what gets the\n\\n=== /start/ ===\ntitle: Start a Project · KR8TIV — free 30-min call or 8-min intake\ndesc: Start a new brand, web, motion, video or AI project with KR8TIV. Book a free no-obligation call at calendly.com/kr8tiv — or fill out the 10-section intake (auto-saves). We accept crypto and fiat.\ncanon: https://kr8tiv.io/start/\nrobots: index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1\nh1: [\"Let's make something worth remembering.\"]\nwords: \u001b[33m1180\u001b[39m video: \u001b[33m0\u001b[39m scripts: \u001b[33m12\u001b[39m\nflags: query \"start\" missing from H1\nout: /, /work/, /process/, /blog/, /terms/, /build-notes/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /services/branding/, /services/print-signage-design/\nin: /404, /blog/blog-that-ranks-and-brings-leads/, /blog/, /blog/local-advertising-edmonton-alberta/, /blog/marketing-campaign-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/, /blog/website-that-earns-its-keep-alberta/, /build-notes/, /, /menu-lab/, /process/, /services/branding/, /services/print-signage-design/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /terms/, /work/\nunres: \n100: 侍 KR8TIV / · 08 HOME DOCTRINE WHY WORK PROCESS NOTES START TERMS 780-915-5471 ⌘ K INTAKE · PROJECT REQUEST Let's make something worth remembering. Four short sections is enough to send this. Only the fields marked ✦ are required — who you are, what you&rsquo;re making, and a rough budget. Everything after that is optional depth for people who think better in writing; fill in as much or as little as you like. We auto-save as you go, so you can close the tab and come back tomorrow. Your answers stay in this browser until you hit submit. Prefer\n\\n=== /terms/ ===\ntitle: Privacy Policy + Terms of Service · KR8TIV\ndesc: KR8TIV Studios privacy policy and terms of service — services, payment, intellectual property, AI integrations, governing law (Alberta, Canada). Last updated August 3, 2026.\ncanon: https://kr8tiv.io/terms/\nrobots: index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-snippet:-1,max-video-preview:-1\nh1: [\"The fine print. Privacy · Terms · Honesty first.\"]\nwords: \u001b[33m3171\u001b[39m video: \u001b[33m1\u001b[39m scripts: \u001b[33m12\u001b[39m\nflags: ok\nout: /, /work/, /process/, /blog/, /start/, /services/web-design-edmonton/, /services/branding/, /services/print-signage-design/\nin: /404, /blog/blog-that-ranks-and-brings-leads/, /blog/, /blog/local-advertising-edmonton-alberta/, /blog/marketing-campaign-edmonton/, /blog/storefront-sign-design-edmonton/, /blog/website-that-earns-its-keep-alberta/, /build-notes/, /, /menu-lab/,