<span>FOUNDER IN EVERY ROOM</span> <span>LUXURY TO CRYPTO</span><span>WEB3 NATIVE</span><span>NO ACCOUNT MANAGERS</span> <span>TEN CLIENTS A YEAR</span><span>FOUNDER-LED</span><span>FOUNDER IN EVERY ROOM</span> <span>LUXURY TO CRYPTO</span><span>WEB3 NATIVE</span><span>NO ACCOUNT MANAGERS</span> </div> </div> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Hero.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.SkJEcaay.js\"></script> <section class=\"doctrine\" id=\"doctrine\"> <!-- preload=\"metadata\" — obelisk is scroll-scrubbed via currentTime\n60→       (see lib/obelisk.ts), so we need duration + first-frame poster\n       on load, but NOT the full byte stream. As the user scrolls and\n       JS pokes currentTime, the browser ranges into the file on demand.\n       Cuts ~3 MB off the initial load vs preload=\"auto\". --> <video class=\"obelisk-vid\" id=\"obelisk-vid\" muted playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/oblisk-kr8tiv.webp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/oblisk-kr8tiv.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"doctrine-head\"> <div> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\"><span class=\"b\"></span>I / DOCTRINE</div> <h2 class=\"chapter-title serif\"> <span class=\"line\"><span>Threading the <span class=\"it\">needle</span></span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>between luxury</span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>and beautiful chaos.</span></span> </h2> </div>  <p>Four rules we don&rsquo;t break. Every one of them cost us something to learn.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">001</span> LONG GAME</div> <p>Your project might be a <em>twenty-dollar</em> business card today and a twenty-thousand-dollar rebrand next year. We&rsquo;re playing the long game.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">002</span> FOUNDER HONEST</div> <p>We&rsquo;ve been the client. We know the pain of agencies that <em>ghost you</em> after the kickoff. So we built the partner we always wished we had.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">003</span> NO LANE</div> <p>Comfortable at both ends — hospitality brands that need <em>restraint</em>, and token launches that need to look like they know something you don&rsquo;t.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">004</span> REAL GOAL</div> <p>Not the biggest studio. The one founders <span class=\"ac\">quietly recommend</span> when they&rsquo;re two whiskeys deep and telling the truth.</p> </div> </div> </section> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Doctrine.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.qz1gBCqS.js\"></script> <aside class=\"inline-cta\" data-variant=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Book a call with KR8TIV\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <div class=\"whisper\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <span class=\"eye\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>NO OBLIGATION · 30 MIN</span>  <span class=\"h\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>Prefer to just talk?</span> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/kr8tiv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"whisper-link\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>Book a call ↳</a> </div> </aside>  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/InlineCTA.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.C2CtB7Ah.js\"></script> <section class=\"services\" id=\"services\"> <div class=\"services-intro\"> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"services-intro-inner\"> <div> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\"><span class=\"b\"></span>II / CAPABILITIES · 011</div> <h2 class=\"chapter-title serif\"> <span class=\"line\"><span>Eleven <span class=\"it\">disciplines</span>.</span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>Scroll sideways.</span></span> </h2> </div> <p> \nOne founder-led studio in Edmonton for the brand, the website, and the work\n          that brings customers in. Matt stays involved. For storefronts, KR8TIV designs\n          and can manage the journey from concept through supplier sourcing, manufacturing\n          coordination and installation liaison. Fabricators and builders do the physical work.\n<span class=\"services-floor-note\">\nFigures are engagement floors, not menu prices — where a real project starts.\n70→            Small one-off pieces sit below them; ask and we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly.\n</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"services-pin\" id=\"svc-pin\"> <div class=\"services-track\" id=\"svc-track\"> <div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 001 — Web Design, Infrastructure Management + Copywriting</div> <h3><span>Website </span><span class=\"ac\">Design</span></h3> <p>Websites that look sharp, explain your offer, and make it clear how to call. Built in Edmonton for businesses across Alberta and Canada.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$1,200+</span></div> <a class=\"svc-more\" href=\"/services/web-design-edmonton/\">Explore website design <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a> </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/2-4.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/2-4.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 002 — Logos, Branding Guides, Assets, Style, Story</div> <h3><span>Branding </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">Identity</span></h3> <p>Your logo, your voice, and a visual system for your website, storefront, packaging, and business cards.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$500+</span></div> <a class=\"svc-more\" href=\"/services/branding/\">Explore branding + identity <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a> </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/12_3.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/12_3.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 003 — Video Editing, Promotional Features + 3D Animation</div> <h3><span>Video </span><span class=\"ac\">Editing</span></h3> <p>Video that stops the scroll and actually gets watched.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$400+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/12_2.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/12_2.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 004 — Dropships, Brands &amp; Everything in Between</div> <h3><span>Ecommerce </span><span class=\"ac\">Setups</span></h3> <p>A customized ecom stack to help you sell anything online.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$1,500+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/2-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/2-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 005 — Product UX, Interface Systems, Design Tokens + Web3 Flows</div> <h3><span>UX/UI </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">Blockchain</span></h3> <p>User experiences people actually love — web apps, mobile apps, and on-chain products.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$1,500+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/8-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/8-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 006 — Storefronts, Signs, 3D Store Experiences, Print, Menus + Hospitality</div> <h3><span>Signage </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">Print</span></h3> <p>Storefronts, signs and immersive store experiences. Start with a concept, or have KR8TIV manage supplier sourcing, production coordination and installation liaison.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">~$500</span></div> <a class=\"svc-more\" href=\"/services/print-signage-design/\">Explore signage + print <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a> </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/7-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/7-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 007 — Ritual-level Packaging Design</div> <h3><span>Packaging </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">Mockups</span></h3> <p>Unboxing is a ritual, not a logistics problem.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$800+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/3-2.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/3-2.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 008 — Web + A/V + Print Studio</div> <h3><span>Studio </span><span>+ </span><span>A/V </span><span class=\"ac\">Print</span></h3> <p>Full studio production: web + audio/video + print, all under one roof.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$1,500+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/forrestbackground.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/forrestbackground.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 009 — Paid Social, Display, Video + Creator Campaigns</div> <h3><span>Ads </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">Acquisition</span></h3> <p>Creative that converts. Built for performance, written for humans.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$900+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/6-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/6-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 010 — Native + Web App Product Design</div> <h3><span>App </span><span>Product </span><span class=\"ac\">Design</span></h3> <p>The full app stack: IA, UX, UI, prototypes, handoff.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$3,500+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/1-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/1-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 011 — Motion, 3D, Cinematic Sequences</div> <h3><span>Motion </span><span>+ </span><span class=\"ac\">3D</span></h3> <p>3D, motion graphics, cinematics — delivered with intent.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$750+</span></div>  </div> <div class=\"svc-frame\" data-cursor=\"media\"> <span class=\"svc-frame-bloom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/9-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/9-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"svc-rec\">REC</div> <div class=\"svc-counter\"><span class=\"n\" id=\"svc-cnt\">01</span>OF 011</div> </div> </section> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Services.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BFhUaMYn.js\"></script> <div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div> <aside class=\"inline-cta\" data-variant=\"loud\" aria-label=\"Book a call with KR8TIV\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <div class=\"box\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <div class=\"eye\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>QUIET FLEX · AI + BRAND</div> <h3 data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>We also build full <em>AI systems</em> for business.</h3> <p data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>Marketing automations, customer-facing agents, internal research tools, content engines. If you're burning hours on work an AI could do faster — we'll tell you honestly whether it's worth building and then build it.</p> <div class=\"row\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/kr8tiv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"cta-primary\" data-cursor=\"magnetic\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> Book a call ↳ </a> <a href=\"/process/\" class=\"cta-ghost\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> Read the process ◊ </a> </div> </div> </aside>   <div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div> <section class=\"why\" id=\"why\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"why-pin\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"why-bg\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>  <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/contactheader-1.webp\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/contactheader-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> </video> </div> <!-- Subtle prism — 6 vertical chromatic bars via CSS gradients.\n         Zero JS cost; mix-blend-mode: screen makes them add color\n         onto the video beneath without blocking it. --> <div class=\"why-prism\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <span style=\"--h:0\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> <span style=\"--h:45\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> <span style=\"--h:180\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> <span style=\"--h:220\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> <span style=\"--h:270\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> <span style=\"--h:320\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span> </div> <!-- Fade-to-black gradients, top and bottom. Anchored to the pin\n         so they stay locked while the section scrolls its 200vh depth. --> <div class=\"why-fade why-fade-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></div> <div class=\"why-fade why-fade-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></div> <div class=\"why-inner\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"why-left\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc><span class=\"b\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc></span>III / MANIFESTO</div> <div class=\"kanji\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>侍</div> <h2 class=\"serif\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <span class=\"line\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc><span data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>Why do</span></span> <span class=\"line\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc><span data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>we <span class=\"it\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>exist?</span></span></span> </h2> </div>  <div class=\"why-right\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"q\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— WHO DOES THE WORK</div> <p data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>The person who shows you the work is the person who <em data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>made</em> it. No account layer, no handoff to a junior, nobody learning on your budget.</p> <cite data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— Matt, founder</cite> </div> <div class=\"q\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— WHAT WE TURN DOWN</div> <p data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>Ten clients a year. The number <em data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>is</em> the product — it is the only way the founder stays in every room and on every draft.</p> <cite data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— Studio policy</cite> </div> <div class=\"q\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc> <div class=\"tag\" data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— WHEN WE SAY NO</div> <p data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>Plenty of calls end with <em data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>you don&rsquo;t need us for this</em>. That answer costs us a project and earns the three that follow.</p> <cite data-astro-cid-ebj2y6yc>— Matt, founder</cite> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Why.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DmufC7Fg.js\"></script> <section class=\"interlude\" id=\"interlude\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <div class=\"interlude-inner\"> <div class=\"interlude-eye\"><span class=\"b\"></span>INTERLUDE</div> <div class=\"interlude-frame\"> <!-- Same loop as the \"Design 34\" Work card (/002 · branding).\n             preload=\"none\" so the bytes don't fly until lazyVideo.ts'\n             IntersectionObserver brings this section into view (autoplay\n             still fires the moment we hit the root margin). The\n             interlude sits BELOW the splash + doctrine + services so it\n             would be a wasted prefetch on first paint. --> <video muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/kr8tiv-assets/posters/Design-29-2-1.webp\"> <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/Design-29-2-1.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> <span class=\"interlude-glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </div> <div class=\"interlude-caption\">— between <em>why</em> &amp; <em>how</em></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"process\" id=\"process-preview\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl> <div class=\"wrap\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl> <div class=\"process-head\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl> <div data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl><span class=\"b\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl></span>IV / THE METHOD</div> <h2 class=\"chapter-title serif\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl> <span class=\"line\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl><span data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl>Four phases.</span></span> <span class=\"line\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl><span data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl>No <span class=\"it\" style=\"view-transition-name: process-headline\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl>surprises</span>.</span></span> </h2> </div> <p style=\"max-width: 360px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.8;\" data-astro-cid-fz4tclxl>\n80→Our engagement model is deliberately simple because the work shouldn&rsquo;t be. The full nine-step playbook — including payment splits + AI-system builds — lives on the process page."}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-variant=\"prism\"> <head><!-- Theme bootstrap: runs before first paint so there is no flash.\n       Dark is ALWAYS the first-visit default, whatever the OS setting.\n       Only an explicit toggle click (stored under kr8tiv-theme-choice)\n       can switch to light. The old key \"kr8tiv-theme\" was auto-written\n       from prefers-color-scheme, so it is ignored and cleared. --><script>(function(){var d=document.documentElement,t='dark';try{localStorage.removeItem('kr8tiv-theme');var s=localStorage.getItem('kr8tiv-theme-choice');if(s==='light'||s==='dark')t=s;}catch(e){}d.setAttribute('data-theme',t);})();</script><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\"><!-- 