 <source src=\"/kr8tiv-assets/oblisk-kr8tiv.mp4?v=2\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </video> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"doctrine-head\"> <div> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\"><span class=\"b\"></span>I / DOCTRINE</div> <h2 class=\"chapter-title serif\"> <span class=\"line\"><span>Threading the <span class=\"it\">needle</span></span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>between luxury</span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>and beautiful chaos.</span></span> </h2> </div>  <p>Four rules we don&rsquo;t break. Every one of them cost us something to learn.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">001</span> LONG GAME</div> <p>Your project might be a <em>twenty-dollar</em> business card today and a twenty-thousand-dollar rebrand next year. We&rsquo;re playing the long game.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">002</span> FOUNDER HONEST</div> <p>We&rsquo;ve been the client. We know the pain of agencies that <em>ghost you</em> after the kickoff. So we built the partner we always wished we had.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">003</span> NO LANE</div> <p>Comfortable at both ends — hospitality brands that need <em>restraint</em>, and token launches that need to look like they know something you don&rsquo;t.</p> </div> <div class=\"stmt\"> <div class=\"num\"><span class=\"i\">004</span> REAL GOAL</div> <p>Not the biggest studio. The one founders <span class=\"ac\">quietly recommend</span> when they&rsquo;re two whiskeys deep and telling the truth.</p> </div> </div> </section> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Doctrine.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.qz1gBCqS.js\"></script> <aside class=\"inline-cta\" data-variant=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Book a call with KR8TIV\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <div class=\"whisper\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo> <span class=\"eye\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>NO OBLIGATION · 30 MIN</span>  <span class=\"h\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>Prefer to just talk?</span> <a href=\"https://calendly.com/kr8tiv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"whisper-link\" data-astro-cid-og5vuuoo>Book a call ↳</a> </div> </aside>  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/InlineCTA.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.C2CtB7Ah.js\"></script> <section class=\"services\" id=\"services\"> <div class=\"services-intro\"> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"services-intro-inner\"> <div> <div class=\"chapter-label mono\"><span class=\"b\"></span>II / CAPABILITIES · 011</div> <h2 class=\"chapter-title serif\"> <span class=\"line\"><span>Eleven <span class=\"it\">disciplines</span>.</span></span> <span class=\"line\"><span>Scroll sideways.</span></span> </h2> </div> <p> \nOne founder-led studio in Edmonton for the brand, the website, and the work\n          that brings customers in. Matt stays involved. For storefronts, KR8TIV designs\n          and can manage the journey from concept through supplier sourcing, manufacturing\n          coordination and installation liaison. Fabricators and builders do the physical work.\n<span class=\"services-floor-note\">\nFigures are engagement floors, not menu prices — where a real project starts.\n70→            Small one-off pieces sit below them; ask and we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly.\n</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"services-pin\" id=\"svc-pin\"> <div class=\"services-track\" id=\"svc-track\"> <div class=\"svc-panel\"> <div class=\"svc-inner\"> <div class=\"svc-copy\"> <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"b\"></span>/ 001 — Web Design, Infrastructure Management + Copywriting</div> <h3><span>Website </span><span class=\"ac\">Design</span></h3> <p>Websites that look sharp, explain your offer, and make it clear how to call. Built in Edmonton for businesses across Alberta and Canada.</p> <div class=\"price\">ENGAGEMENTS FROM<span class=\"p\">$1,200+</span></div> <a class=\"svc-more\" href=\"/services/web-design-edmonton/\">Explore website design <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a> </div> 