{"type":"thought","data":"A file permission issue"}
{"type":"thought","data":" blocked the `touch`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe sandbox blocks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" writes outside the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"workspace. Git metadata"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sits outside the workspace,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so commits cannot be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" written there. A full"}
{"type":"thought","data":" git clone inside the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" workspace would allow"}
{"type":"thought","data":" committing, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" original repository"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would remain unchanged."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe driver likely "}
{"type":"thought","data":"inspects the external"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gitdir via `git log`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A local `.git` file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the workspace would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not satisfy this check."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The parent agent would still push the feature branch from the main repository without the commit."}
